conjugators are witnesses only. `Three.Sylow` checks the equations on the
certified four-point base and uses the carrier order to prove Sylow maximality.

Source: retained ATLAS `J2G1-p100B0` normal forms. Reproduce the witnesses with
`Three/source/generate_sylow.py`; attribution is retained in the adjacent README.
-/

